      ro: "Cashel se află în comitatul Tipperary. Orașul este strâns legat de Rock of Cashel, un complex istoric de fortificații.",
      en: "Cashel is located in County Tipperary. The town is closely associated with the Rock of Cashel, a historic fortress complex.",
