      en: ["The Dominican friary (Priory) was founded in 1244.", "Scrabo Tower stands 38 meters high and was finished in 1857.", "The Georgian Town Hall was built in the market square in 1770.", "Strangford Lough is the largest marine inlet in the British Isles.", "Scrabo Tower was built to honor the 3rd Marquess of Londonderry.", "The town is located approximately 10 miles (16 km) from Belfast."],
