      en: ["Founded in 1661 by the 1st Earl of Orrery", "Named in honor of King Charles II", "Key center for the Irish dairy industry", "Located on the N20 road between Cork and Limerick", "Station on the Dublin-to-Cork railway line opened in 1849", "The Irish name Rath Luirc was used officially for decades"],
