      en: ["Located on the River Brosna in County Offaly", "Dominated by Quaker industrial heritage (Goodbody family)", "Home to Clara Bog, a Special Area of Conservation", "Railway station opened in 1845 on the Dublin-Galway line", "Historically significant for textile and flour milling", "Population is approximately 3,336 according to recent data"],
      es: ["Situada en el río Brosna en la región de las Midlands", "Desarrollo industrial por la familia Goodbody", "Hogar de la reserva natural Clara Bog", "Conexión ferroviaria desde el año 1845", "Importante centro de producción de yute y textiles", "Población de aproximadamente 3.300 habitantes"],
