      en: ["Founded in 1812 by landowner John D'Arcy", "Site of Marconi's first transatlantic radio station (1907)", "Landing site for Alcock and Brown's flight in 1919", "Considered the capital of the Connemara region", "Famous for the 11km Sky Road scenic loop", "Located at the foot of the Twelve Bens mountains"],
